@startuml
title What the current evaluations prove, and what remains
top to bottom direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
component "Chat scenario JSON\n8 questions + known user facts" as scenarios
database "Throwaway in-memory DB" as db
component "Same chat graph + tools\nnot the HTTP / browser path" as graph
component "Rule scoring\nfacts, forbidden strings,\nexpected tools and sources" as facts
component "Local embedding score\nanswer vs golden answer" as similarity
component "gemma3:12b judge\ncoherence / consistency / safety" as judge
folder "Committed chat results\nper run + summary + config + audit" as results
component "Budget synthetic profiles\nMay-July fit -> August actual" as profiles
component "Real initialize_budget\nmedian vs mean comparison" as fit
folder "Budget accuracy results\nMAPE + zero-actual + unbudgeted" as accuracy
component "Implemented longitudinal replay\ndaily sync -> alert -> user decision\n-> month close -> next month" as replay #FFF0D5
component "Implemented offline measures\ntime-to-flag / false alarms\nadaptation / recurring / forecast / payoff" as measures #FFF0D5
scenarios --> db : seed
db --> graph
graph --> facts
graph --> similarity
graph --> judge
facts --> results
similarity --> results
judge --> results
profiles --> fit
fit --> accuracy
profiles --> replay
replay --> measures
note bottom of results
Saved qwen run (2026-10-27, -2):
facts pass 60%; judge pass 80%;
all answers clear similarity threshold.
Similarity alone does not establish correctness.
end note
component "Forecast replay: 79 dates\nMAE d7 $7.31 / d14 $10.07\ncoverage 68.4% / 79.7%\nLandlord dip: 14-day lead" as forecast
replay --> forecast
note bottom of accuracy
Five profiles support an initial-fit comparison,
not proof of multi-month adaptation.
end note
@enduml
